{"term": {"label": "親", "occurrences": 1, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-i", "title": "梁惠王上", "description": "孟子見梁惠王。王曰：「叟不遠千里而來，亦將有以利吾國乎？」\n孟子對曰：「王何必曰利？亦有仁義而已矣。王曰『何以利吾國』？大夫曰『何以利吾家』？士庶人曰『何以利吾身』？上下交征利而國危矣。萬乘之國弒其君者，必千乘之家；千乘之國弒其君者，必百乘之家。萬取千焉，千取百焉，不為不多矣。苟為後義而先利，不奪不饜。未有仁而遺其親者"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "今", "id": "今"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "敵", "id": "敵"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "親", "id": "親"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.717651497074333, "source": "敵", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.4855078157817008, "source": "今", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.717651497074333, "source": "今", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.277267285009756, "source": "今", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 0.4054651081081644, "source": "今", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 3.3270894095084333, "source": "親", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.3217558399823195, "source": "政", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.6339422289484884, "source": "政", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.8186522623102391, "source": "政", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 2.6339422289484884, "source": "義", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.12550508175029376, "source": "義", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 0.44628710262841953, "source": "民", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 0.7621400520468967, "source": "民", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.6645015824829807, "source": "仁", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 0.14903557916048796, "source": "仁", "target": "人"}]}}